Modified class: com.healthmarketscience.jackcess.impl.IndexData.
Change: skip index DELETE/ADD only when old and new encoded keys are byte-identical
for the same row id. Actual key changes retain Jackcess's original update and
constraint path. This does not repair or remove existing source indexes.

scripts/PatchJackcess.java verifies and extracts the pinned official source,
applies the documented insertion, and places the class in generated-sources.
Maven tests and the shaded Docker artifact both use this generated class ahead
of the dependency's original class. The full original source is not vendored.
